{"name":"Shallow Shore","hex":"#b0dec8","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"shallow","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Having little depth; significantly less deep than wide.","Extending not far downward."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A shallow portion of an otherwise deep body of water.","A fish, the rudd."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/shallow"},{"term":"shore","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Land adjoining a non-flowing body of water, such as an ocean, lake or pond.","Land, usually near a port."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To arrive at the shore","To put ashore."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/shore"}],"entries":[{"title":"Shallow (Lady Gaga and Bradley Cooper song)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Shallow\" is a song performed by American singer Lady Gaga and American actor and filmmaker Bradley Cooper. It was released through Interscope Records on September 27, 2018, as the lead single from the soundtrack to the 2018 musical romantic drama film A Star Is Born. \"Shallow\" was written by Gaga with Mark Ronson, Anthony Rossomando and Andrew Wyatt, and produced by Gaga with Benjamin Rice. The song is heard three times in the film, most prominently during a sequence when Cooper's character Jackson Maine invites Gaga's character Ally to perform it onstage with him. The scene was filmed in front of a live audience at the Greek Theater in Los Angeles."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shallow_(Lady_Gaga_and_Bradley_Cooper_song)"},{"title":"Coast","blocks":[{"text":"A coast is the land next to the sea or the line that forms the boundary between the land and the ocean or a lake. Coasts are influenced by the topography of the surrounding landscape and by aquatic erosion, such as that caused by waves. The geological composition of rock and soil dictates the type of shore that is created. Earth has about 620,000.0 km (385,250.1 mi) of coastline."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ea/Spring_Lake%2C_New_Jersey_Beach_at_Sunrise.jpg/330px-Spring_Lake%2C_New_Jersey_Beach_at_Sunrise.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coast"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8e/Greek_Theater_2007.JPG/500px-Greek_Theater_2007.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8e/Greek_Theater_2007.JPG/1280px-Greek_Theater_2007.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8e/Greek_Theater_2007.JPG/500px-Greek_Theater_2007.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The Greek Theater, Los Angeles where Gaga and Cooper recorded and filmed the sequence for \"Shallow\"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGreek_Theater_2007.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Dirty_Pretty_Things_-_SXSW_2006_%28cropped%29_Anthony_Rossomando.jpg/330px-Dirty_Pretty_Things_-_SXSW_2006_%28cropped%29_Anthony_Rossomando.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Dirty_Pretty_Things_-_SXSW_2006_%28cropped%29_Anthony_Rossomando.jpg/330px-Dirty_Pretty_Things_-_SXSW_2006_%28cropped%29_Anthony_Rossomando.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADirty_Pretty_Things_-_SXSW_2006_(cropped)_Anthony_Rossomando.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/25/Miike_Snow_Sasquatch.jpg/500px-Miike_Snow_Sasquatch.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/25/Miike_Snow_Sasquatch.jpg/1280px-Miike_Snow_Sasquatch.